Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在面临被毁灭的氪星上 一位聪明的科学家将他的新生儿子放进太空船里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,并将太空船驶向地球 这个小男孩被一对农村夫妇抚养长大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他成了地球最伟大的保护者 超人 可是当太空人发现了氪星残骸时 超人消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:52.65,Default,,0,0,8,,《超人归来》
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.51,0:23:59.93,Default,,0,0,8,,(普利兹奖 露意丝·莲恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:05.53,Default,,0,0,8,,(普利兹奖 露意丝·莲恩)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.43,0:24:08.83,Default,,0,0,8,,(获奖作品： 为何这世界不需要超人)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.94,0:24:16.64,Default,,0,0,8,,(为何这世界不需要超人)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.00,0:47:04.30,Default,,0,0,8,,(超人回来啦)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.19,0:47:12.99,Default,,0,0,8,,(陨石碎片和宝石 现于大都会自然科学博物馆展览中)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.87,1:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,(1978年  亚的斯亚贝巴L9铁矿陨石)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.85,1:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,(硼硅酸锂纳 氢氧化物以及氟化物  埃塞俄比亚·亚的斯亚贝巴)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.79,1:20:44.49,Default,,0,0,8,,(来电： 星球日报)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.90,1:21:53.40,Default,,0,0,8,,(来电： 理查 未接)
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.13,1:37:49.57,Default,,0,0,8,,(40N 73W 救命)
Dialogue: 0,2:21:34.33,2:21:36.73,Default,,0,0,8,,(为什么世界需要超人)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.12,0:01:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你将到很远的地方去 我的小凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will travel far, my little Kal-EI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.25,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们永远不会离开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we will never leave you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.83,0:01:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,就算死亡已近在我们眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...even in the face of our deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把我的力量给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will make my strength your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.63,0:01:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你会透过你的眼睛看见我的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will see my life through your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.88,0:01:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如同我会透过我的眼睛看见你的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as your life will be seen through mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.97,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子变成了父亲 父亲又变成了儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son becomes the father, and the father the son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你的过去如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In spite of your past...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I know you're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all good men...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,都有重新来过的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...deserve a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,从我收到你的第一封信起…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the moment I received your first letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道你和其他人不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I knew you were not like the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你开始什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came from nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.79,0:05:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,经过了极大的努力才达到现在的地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you worked so hard to get where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,其间也许犯了一些错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might have made a few mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,加图德 看在上帝的份上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gertrude, for God's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 加图德 让我们进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Gertrude, let us in now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过如果我帮你逃出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that if I helped you get out of prison...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你就会对我很好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'd take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的确做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我感受到前所未有的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've shown me pleasures that I've never known.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.53,0:06:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你将得到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you deserve...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.29,0:06:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯·路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Lex Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,加图德 让我们进去 他是个骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gertrude, let us in. He's a crook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他不爱你呀 加图德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't love you, Gertrude!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.48,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个坏人 加图德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a monster! Gertrude!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你留着吧 - 哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can keep that. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,其它的都是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.59,0:07:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 玛莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye, Martha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个东西弄走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you get that thing out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯 你的朋友让我感觉很不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex, your friends give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.22,0:11:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱本来就不是舒服的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prison is a creepy place, Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,想要活下来的话 你就得跟一些牛鬼蛇神做朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One needs to make creepy friends in order to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.89,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面 像我一个这么聪明的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even a man with my vast talents is won'th less inside...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.56,0:11:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也不比一条香烟或口袋里一把利器值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than a can'ton of cigarettes and a sharp piece of metal in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你听过普洛米修斯的故事吗 你当然没听过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the story of Prometheus? No, of course you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,普洛米修斯从其它神那里偷了火的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus was a god who stole the power of fire from the other gods...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他把火给了人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and gave control of it to mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以说 他给了我们科技 他给了我们力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In essence, he gave us technology. He gave us power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.41,0:12:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要去北极偷火？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're stealing fire? In the Arctic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.12,0:12:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可以这么说 你想想 谁控制了科技谁就控制了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, sort of. You see, whoever controls technology controls the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,古罗马帝国因为造路而统治世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Roman Empire ruled the world because they built roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大英帝国因为造船而统治世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The British Empire ruled the world because they built ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,美国因为原子弹…等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}America, the atom bomb, and so on and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.55,0:12:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的东西和普洛米修斯一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want what Prometheus wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来很棒 雷克斯 但你不是神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds great, Lex, but you're not a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.27,0:12:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,神只不过是披着红披风 整天飞来飞去的自私之徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gods are selfish beings who fly around in little red capes...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,而不把他的力量与人类分享\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and don't share their power with mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想当神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't wanna be a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.62,0:12:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想把火种带给人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wanna bring fire to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,并且 我也要我自己那份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want my cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他以前的家吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was this his house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,大部份人都会这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might think so. Most would.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,较正确的说法是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is more of a monument to a long dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个非常强大的 远古文明留下来的遗址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and extremely powerful civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里得知他的身世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where he learned who he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.18,0:13:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,当他迷惘时他在这里寻求方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where he came for guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.99,0:14:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,无限的可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Endless possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来好像你来过这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You act like you've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My son...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.45,0:15:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不记得我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you do not remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我是佐尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Jor-EI.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.62,0:15:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经死了几千年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By now, I will have been dead many thousands of your years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他把我当成他的儿子了 - 你是氪星惟一的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He thinks I'm his son. - You are the only survivor of Krypton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你前面的这些水晶里储存着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Embedded in the crystals before you is the total accumulation of all literature...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,第28银河系里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and scientific fact from dozens of other worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,数十个文明发展的所有文学和科学知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...spanning the 28 known galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里会提出许多问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are questions to be asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here in this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,隐密的堡垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This Fortress of Solitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将共同追寻解答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we shall try to find the answers together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.99,0:16:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他看得到我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can he see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, my son...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Kal-EI...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,问吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.05,0:16:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我所有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,从水晶开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...starting with crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.21,0:19:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,周二 在支持者间…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Tuesday, between support...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,消防队员们的奋力扑救…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hindered the firefighting efforts for all those...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,警察终于到来 但现场还是一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police have finally arrived and it's still complete mayhem down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.93,0:20:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,战事在最南边区域打响…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fighting broke out in the southernmost region...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.47,0:20:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,边境上小规模武器袭击时有发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with border fire and small-arms attacks prevalent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我早上把它埋起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I buried it this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想让他在大陪审团面前作证是徒劳的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was futile trying to force him to testify before a grand jury.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.15,0:20:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,五年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你爸爸还在世 他绝不会让你走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your father was alive, he never would have let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.16,0:20:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点放弃了希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost gave up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我再也看不到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到你要找的东西了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find what you were looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾想过 满怀希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought, hoped...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它也许还在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it might still be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.31,0:20:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你的家乡？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your home?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那个地方像座坟场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That place was a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一的生还者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.11,0:21:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 宇宙是非常浩大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, the universe is a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道宇宙里还有谁在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you don't know who's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.24,0:21:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就算你真的是最后一个生存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And even if you are the last...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你也不会孤单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.15,0:21:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.49,0:21:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.90,0:21:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.99,0:21:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能小心点？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Would you be careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.83,0:22:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉米 - 克拉克先生 不 我是说 肯特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jimmy. - Mr. Clark! I mean, Kent! Mr. Kent!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我… 你在这等着我马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come... Wait right there. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.97,0:22:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 各位 我还在找住的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, sorry, guys, I'm still looking for a place to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...if you know of anything reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.52,0:22:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在你后面 肯特先生 这个蛋糕是我自己做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you, Mr. Kent. I made it myself. It's a cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.61,0:22:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很好吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.99,0:22:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,欧森 生日派对小丑大屠杀事件的照片呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olsen! Where are the photos of that birthday-clown-massacre thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在办 主编 看看谁回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it, chief. Hey, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.50,0:22:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯特？ - 嘿 主编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kent? - Hey, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.04,0:22:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你让我回到这里来上班 - 别谢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you for giving me my job back. - Don't thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该谢诺姆·帕诺死的正是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank Norm Palmer for dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.92,0:22:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他也寿终正寝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was his time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.17,0:22:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来帮你整理一下吧 - 欧森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's get you set up, huh? - Olsen!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.93,0:22:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, so I gotta run...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.34,0:23:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我马上就回来 肯特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but I will be back to check on you in a sec, Mr. Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.81,0:23:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道露意丝在哪吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, do you know where I can find Lois?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,自动点火前倒计时那段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The timing of this automated-ignition countdown...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.45,0:23:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是最不稳定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is the most precarious part of the launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.04,0:23:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝·莲恩 星球日报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane, Daily Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.58,0:23:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你说新的太空梭将带领我们进入一个新纪元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You also stated that the shuttle will usher in a new era of travel...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.00,0:23:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,连一个普通平民也付得起星际旅行的费用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...enabling the average person to afford transcontinental flights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能告诉我们一个实际的数字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But can you tell us the exact price...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.46,0:23:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,人均花费估计是多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an "average person" will be expected to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.26,0:23:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这个问题有不同的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer to that question is in your press packet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.09,0:23:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,地球被一团空气覆盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Earth is surrounded by a blanket of air...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.01,0:23:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们称之为大气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which we call the atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.56,0:23:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,它延伸到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It reaches over...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.19,0:24:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他看上去就像他的妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. He looks just like his mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.15,0:24:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,连行为举止都像 尤其在"闯祸"这方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Already takes after her too, especially when it comes to getting into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.32,0:24:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.66,0:24:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你离开太久可能不知道 露意丝·莲恩是个妈妈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, well, I guess you've been gone. Fearless reporter Lois Lane is a mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.67,0:24:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是… 给我吧 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you know, I'll just... I'll take that. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.13,0:24:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 没关系 反正她很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. - No. She's got plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.21,0:25:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 她结婚了吗？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, she's married? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,也不算是 更像是超长的婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Not really. It's more like a prolonged engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.89,0:25:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你可别问她何时结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't ask Miss Lane when they're tying the knot...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.51,0:25:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,她很讨厌这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because she hates that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.23,0:25:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像要履行国家宇航局同样的安全条例？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this follow the same stringent safety guidelines set by NASA?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.86,0:25:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,既然这是和空军联合的行动…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since this is a joint venture with the Air Force...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.65,0:25:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？ 你看起来好像需要去喝一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right? You look like you could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.57,0:25:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方真破烂 我们回来这里干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is so tacky. Why are we back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.99,0:25:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,咪咪 当你忙着修你的指甲 和在网上购买貂皮大衣时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitty, while you were doing your nails and ordering fur coats online...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.79,0:25:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是在忙着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I was busy unlocking the secrets...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.71,0:25:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,解开宇宙最先进文明的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of one of the most advanced civilizations in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,本来不是有两只吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Werert there two of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.17,0:25:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 比起地球上使用的笨拙建筑方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, unlike our clunky earthbound forms of construction...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.59,0:25:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星 也就是超人的母星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the technology on Krypton, Supermars home world...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.22,0:25:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,利用水晶的生长来建造东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was based on manipulating the growth of crystals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.80,0:25:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像在变魔术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like hocus-pocus to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们这些原始的脑袋来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, naturally, to the primitive mind, any sufficiently advanced technology...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.27,0:25:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,超先进的科技跟变魔术没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would be indistinguishable from magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.56,0:26:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但想象一下 城市 车辆 武器…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But imagine: Cities, vehicles, weapons...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.52,0:26:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,整个大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...entire continents...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.48,0:26:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...all grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.91,0:26:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,很难想像能从一个这么简单的物体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To think that one could create a new world...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.41,0:26:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,创造出一个新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with such a simple little object.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.13,0:26:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,它就像一个种子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.59,0:26:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它只需要水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all it needs is water.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.01,0:26:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就像…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.26,0:26:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,海猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Sea-Monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.93,0:26:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 咪咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly, Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.77,0:26:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就像海猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Sea-Monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.64,0:26:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克这几年做了很多心灵之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark has been doing a little soul-searching for the last couple years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.40,0:26:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他见了好几位喇嘛 - 是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He saw Ilamas. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.57,0:26:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 回来对你来说很困难吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Must be tough coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来？ - 回来工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Coming back? - To work.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.41,0:26:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,变化了很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you know, things change.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.04,0:27:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 事物当然会变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, of course things change...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.25,0:27:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但有时候一些你觉得不会变的也变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but sometimes things that you didn't think would change could change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.59,0:27:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,例如露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take Lois.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.34,0:27:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到像她这样的女人会安定下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A woman like her, I never thought she'd settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.76,0:27:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你问我… 因为她永远不会说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you ask me... Because she'll never tell you this...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.60,0:27:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你问我 她还在爱着"那个人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but if you ask me, she's still in love with you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.82,0:27:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,原本的太空梭在发射时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The original space shuttle generated 7.5 million pounds of thrust...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.86,0:27:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,会产生750万磅的推动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...just in the initial launch phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.74,0:27:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们把它装载在波音777的背上时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, by piggybacking on this Boeing 777... Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.66,0:27:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这次的发射真如你说的那么重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this launch is as pivotal as you claim...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.87,0:27:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么只有一家媒体来采访这个消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why is it being covered by one news network?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.33,0:27:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们何不把这问题留到发射后的记者会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we save those questions for the post-launch briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.71,0:27:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗 莲恩小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that, Miss Lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们到达四万尺时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we hit 40,000 feet, the shuttle will detach, ascend...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太空梭会解放第一组的液态推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then fire the first of two propellant systems, the liquid fuel boosters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.01,0:28:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们到达平流层时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the shuttle reaches the stratosphere...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.22,0:28:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,第二组推进器会被点燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the secondary insertion booster will fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.52,0:28:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然后以4g的加速度将我们推入中气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...propelling the craft at 4gs into the mesosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.73,0:28:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Careful. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.74,0:28:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心 小心 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Careful. Careful. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.97,0:28:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真剌激啊 雷克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's really something, Lex.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.60,0:28:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,再等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.31,0:28:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 真剌激啊 雷克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's really something, Lex.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.53,0:28:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,剌激度可媲美《飘》了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's freaking Gone With the Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.91,0:29:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把摄影机关了 - 我还在拍摄啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shut off the camera. - But I'm getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.12,0:29:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我说把摄影机关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, shut off the damn camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.54,0:29:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像弄坏了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I did something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.42,0:29:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That wasrt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.32,0:29:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,1分钟点火倒计时 准备进行梭机分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ignition is at T minus one minute and we are prepping for separation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.16,0:29:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,机长 请开始计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CDR, start the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.29,0:29:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,3分钟倒计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.79,0:29:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,主体信号正常 各部分零件正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Body signs normal. Crew is looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.21,0:29:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太空梭仪表稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shuttle readouts are holding steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.05,0:29:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还是要准备发射 - 明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're still a go for launch. - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 休斯敦 收到请回答 - 休斯敦 收到请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Houston, you copy? - Houston, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.15,0:30:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,电力不稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Electrical variance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.69,0:30:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,大家别慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.33,0:30:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们好像有个小小的停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems that we are experiencing a slight power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.55,0:30:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么？ - 什么都没做 只是打开了备用电源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do? - It wasrt me. It just cycled back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.55,0:30:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"创世纪" 和休士顿确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis, radio check from Houston.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.85,0:30:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们确认是短暂的停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we have it. We were experiencing a power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.77,0:30:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爬升至四万尺 - 收到 四万尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Climbing to 40,000 feet. - Roger, 40,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他得分了 惊人的快球…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's gone! A blazing fastball...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.01,0:31:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,停了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.44,0:31:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,还没呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.24,0:32:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,双引擎失效 但是又恢复运转了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dual engine failure, but they're up and running again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"创世纪" 很遗憾 我们必须中止这次发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis, I hate to say this, but it looks like we're gonna have to scrub the launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.91,0:32:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 中止推进器点火 - 收到 中止推进器点火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aborting booster ignition. - Roger. Aborting booster ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.17,0:32:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,推进器没反应 点火还在倒数计时中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boosters are non-responsive. We're still counting down for ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 运载机 我们有麻烦了 - 请讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Platform, we have a problem. - Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.46,0:32:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,看来跳电时什么东西坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like something faulted during the power outage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.05,0:32:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,两组推进器都还在倒数计时中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both boosters are counting down for ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.55,0:32:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,运载机 还有30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Platform, you have 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.68,0:32:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 解除连接器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Release couplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.10,0:32:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法关掉推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can 't shut down boosters.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:33:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,太空梭可以自行发射然后紧急迫降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be able to manage the launch and recover to the emergency field.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.27,0:33:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,倒数23妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}T minus 23 seconds to ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.98,0:33:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"创世纪" 允进启动紧急疏散程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genesis, you're a go for evac procedures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.56,0:33:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,21 20\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-one, twenty...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.57,0:33:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,19\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.20,0:33:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,连接器没有反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couplings are non-responsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.99,0:33:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还连在上面 - 17\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're still attached. - Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.99,0:33:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 连接器也卡死了 - 15\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Platform, couplings are jammed. - Fifteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.20,0:33:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,14\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.91,0:33:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不用紧张 这是正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be alarmed. It's absolutely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.92,0:33:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,还是解不开 连接器无反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still attached. Couplings are non-responsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.67,0:33:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 9 8… - 休斯敦 你能从远端解除吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nine, eight... - Houston, can you do a remote override?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.47,0:33:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,7\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 远端解除无效 - 6 5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Remote override is unresponsive. - Six, five...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.06,0:33:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 重复一遍 远端解除无效 - 4 3…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I repeat, remote override is unresponsive. -Four, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.52,0:33:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,运气好的话还可以听到小声的音爆喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you're lucky, you may hear the faint pop of the sonic boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.61,0:33:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 休斯敦 点火成功 - 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Houston, we have ignition. - Roger, ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.20,0:34:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这是蟒蛇21号 太空梭快速远去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Python 21, she's pulling away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.58,0:34:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,飞行控制启动中…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, all flight control is on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是演习 疏散无关人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a drill. Clear nonessential personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.00,0:34:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,启动紧急应对方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Switch to emergency band frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.71,0:34:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.47,0:34:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.68,0:34:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来帮帮我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get a little help?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.02,0:34:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是华盛顿UPV电台的即时新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is UPV breaking news. From Washington, Frank Jacobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.27,0:34:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚得到消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just received word...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.69,0:34:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"创世纪"太空梭在空中遇到问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that the inaugural flight of the Genesis space shuttle...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.61,0:34:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,半空中遇到紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is experiencing a midair emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.99,0:34:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,新一代"创世纪"发射遭遇问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A problem with the launch of the new orbital shuttle, Genesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,消息来源指出创世纪未能和777解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reports are telling us the shuttle failed to disengage...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.58,0:34:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,导致二机一起冲向太空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...sending both crafts rocketing towards space.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.66,0:34:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,现在将镜头转回卡纳维尔角… 关注最新动向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're now going live to Cape Canaveral for the latest update on this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.46,0:34:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,吉姆 我们现在只知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jim, all we know right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.96,0:34:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,777出现故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is that the couplings which hold the shuttle to the 777...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.92,0:35:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,机梭未按计划分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...malfunctioned and did not release as planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.26,0:35:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们还不确定… - 我应该…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're uncertain... - I should do...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.97,0:35:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为何点火程序继续推进器发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...why the ignition sequence continued and boosters fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然而 停电导致很大问题…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, there's speculation here that the blackout, which...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.99,0:35:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,扶我坐起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.20,0:35:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,火狐1号仍连接在太空梭上 已爬升至42000尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mach one. Still tied to the shuttle at 42,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.96,0:35:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 休斯敦 我们请求支援  - 准备运行故障诊断程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Houston, we need some help. Houston! - Running diagnostics check. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.63,0:35:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"入轨推进器"点火5秒倒计时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insertion booster ignition in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.48,0:35:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,警告 警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.69,0:36:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.07,0:36:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有不知名的敌机从北面过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some kind of unidentified bogey coming from the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.16,0:36:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 了解 - 而且以超快的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger that. - And it's coming in fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.49,0:38:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Declaring an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.03,0:39:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,超速 超速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Overspeed, overspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.84,0:39:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,高度…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Altitude...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.73,0:39:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,上升 上升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly up, fly up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.40,0:40:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.54,0:40:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.22,0:40:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那么我希望大家不要因此次事件 而害怕飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I hope this experience hasn't put any of you off flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.60,0:40:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为数据上来说 飞行还是最安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Statistically speaking, it's still the safest way to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.44,0:40:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 超人 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman! Superman! Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.82,0:41:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.07,0:42:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大家听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, everybody, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.24,0:42:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我要知道所有的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know it all, everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,欧森 我要他的照片占满所有版面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Olsen, I wanna see photos of him everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.06,0:42:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我要看到他的"独家"照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I want the photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.25,0:42:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,体育版 他们如何把飞机运出场外？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sports, how are they gonna get that plane out of the stadium?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.21,0:42:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,旅游版 他之前去哪了？ 渡假吗？ 在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel, where did he go? Was he on vacation? If so, where?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.92,0:42:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,八卦版 他有新恋情吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gossip, has he met somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.57,0:42:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,时尚版 他穿的超人服是新的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fashion, is that a new suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.30,0:42:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,健康版 他增重了吗？ 他都吃些什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Health, has he gained weight? What's he been eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.88,0:42:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,商务版 这对股市有什么影响？ 短期或长期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Business, how is this gonna affect the stock market? Long-term, short-term.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.64,0:43:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,政治版 他还是正义和事实的代表吗 生活版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Politics, does he still stand for truth, justice, all that stuff? Lifestyle:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.81,0:43:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"超人归来"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Superman Returns."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.23,0:43:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.66,0:43:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,吉伯 "灾难性"这个字里有几个"F"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gil, how many F's in "catastrophic"?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.53,0:43:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一个都没有 如何使用？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None. What's the usage?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.33,0:43:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,神秘的电磁波让所有的电子产品及 便携设备失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"This mysterious electromagnetic pulse knocked out portable devices...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.71,0:43:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,导致一连串灾难性的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and entire power grids, causing a catastrophic event during..."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.83,0:43:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露意丝  - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.54,0:43:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,到我办公室来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.96,0:43:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大家也都听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This goes for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.59,0:43:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这次的新闻不是大停电 而是超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story isn't the blackout, it's Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.55,0:43:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,主编 电磁波事件才是真正的新闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story is the EMP, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.39,0:43:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,东岸所有的电子仪器都在瞬间失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every electronic device on the East Coast goes dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.06,0:43:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 首先 你没事吧 - 没事 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- First, are you okay? - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.35,0:43:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 好卖的报纸有三要素： 惨案 性 还有超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, three things sell papers: Tragedy, sex and Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.52,0:43:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,人们对灾难已快失去兴趣了 你对性爱又一窍不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are sick of tragedy, we know you can't write won'th a damn about sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.28,0:43:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,所以剩下来的只剩超人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means one thing. That one thing is Superman. And you know it, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.41,0:43:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.53,0:44:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.95,0:44:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 谢天谢地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, I'm fine. - Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.79,0:44:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杰森呢？ - 他不是跟你在一起吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Jason? - I don 't know. Isn 't he with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.62,0:44:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 他人呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Well, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.12,0:44:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.39,0:44:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.22,0:44:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我是克拉克·肯特 我在你还没出生时就和你妈妈是朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Clark Kent, an old friend of your mom's from before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.93,0:44:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？ 她从来没提过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? She never mentioned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.19,0:44:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？ 从没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Never?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.06,0:44:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从没 - 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Jason.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.48,0:44:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在这里做什么 宝贝？ - 爸爸的办公室好无聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing here, honey? - Daddy's office is boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.36,0:44:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸的办公室好无聊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy's office is boring?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.36,0:44:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 嗨 欢迎回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, hey! Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.33,0:44:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你已经见过我儿子了 - 对啊 我们正在聊天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I see you've already met the munchkin. - Yeah, we were just talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.75,0:44:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你吃维生素了吗 点眼药了吗？ - 吃了 点了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you take vitamins? Eye drops? - Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.96,0:44:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 气喘药呢？ 波利拜弗呢？ - 都吃了 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Albuterol? Poly-Vi-Flor? - Yes. Yes, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.34,0:44:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,乖孩子 他现在身体不太好 但他长大以后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy. He's a little fragile, but he's gonna grow up...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.51,0:44:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一定会长得跟他爸爸一样高大强壮 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to be big and strong like his dad, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.01,0:45:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.43,0:45:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见你在那飞机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I saw you on the...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.93,0:45:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. That was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.76,0:45:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的订书机能借我吗？ - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, can I borrow your stapler? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.14,0:45:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.65,0:45:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你得到普利兹奖 真不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations on the Pulitzer. That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.69,0:45:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀 难以相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Can you believe it? It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.78,0:45:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你的旅行如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I wanna hear all about your trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.91,0:45:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你去了哪里？ 看到什么？ 认识了什么人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you go? What did you see? Meet anyone special?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.74,0:45:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了 我不知从何说起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's so much. Where to begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.37,0:45:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那小子呢？ 嘿 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the little guy? Hey, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.04,0:45:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？ - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你能不能向你的叔叔拉点亲戚关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you work some magic to get your uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.71,0:45:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,让他不要一直为难我这篇报导？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to stop giving me such a hard time on this article?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.92,0:45:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行吗？ - 又一次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please? - Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.59,0:45:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 又一次 - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Again. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.76,0:45:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 孩子？ - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are you, kiddo? - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.14,0:45:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 这是克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.39,0:45:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克 理查；理查 克拉克 - 理查·怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark, Richard. Richard, Clark. - Richard White.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.77,0:45:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.19,0:45:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,理查是这里的副编辑 他一手拯救了我们的国际版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard's an assistant editor here who's basically saved our International section.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.73,0:46:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他也是个飞行员 喜欢看恐怖电影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's also a pilot and he loves horror movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.74,0:46:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark is...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.11,0:46:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.28,0:46:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴终于见到你 我听说了很多你的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's great to finally meet you. I've heard so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.29,0:46:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 吉米这小子一直说到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you have? - Yeah, Jimmy won't shut up about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.29,0:46:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该走了 - 去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gotta run. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.92,0:46:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到啦 派瑞说超人回来了 而我是唯一能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard Perry. Supermars back, and he thinks I'm the only one equipped to...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.34,0:46:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.09,0:46:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 那就别理他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know, you know. - So don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.63,0:46:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不理啊 我现在要去发电厂调查停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not. Going to the power plant to check out the blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.59,0:46:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.10,0:46:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈再见 - 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, Mom. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.27,0:46:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见 露意丝 - 她走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bye, Lois. - And she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.98,0:46:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我们有多亲近 对我来说那女人一直是个谜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how close we are, that woman will always be a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.61,0:46:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,需要什么的话 我的办公室在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you need anything, I'm right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.78,0:46:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to finally meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.53,0:46:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪？ 去公园吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you wanna go? Wanna go to the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.95,0:46:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 整个世界 在他手中 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And he's got the whole world In his hands. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.00,0:47:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 整个世界... ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ He's got the whole world... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.33,0:47:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,∮ 整个世界 在他手中 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ And he's got the whole world in his hands. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.46,0:47:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他蛮可爱的嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, he's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.86,0:47:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,碰上麻烦吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run into trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.36,0:47:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你应该问对方 - 我们接下来做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should see the other guy. - What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.78,0:47:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你们把它改造后装在船尾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modify it, attach it to the stern.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.61,0:47:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管说明书是不是俄文写成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care if the instructions are Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.19,0:48:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露意丝 - 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois? - Hey, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.77,0:48:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,回来工作的感觉怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it feel to be back at work?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.69,0:48:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,蛮不错呀 就像骑脚踏车吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty good. You know, kind of like riding a bike, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.78,0:48:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 脚踏车？ - 对呀 嗯…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A bike? - Yeah, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.07,0:48:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.91,0:48:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来后我们还没有聚在一起聊聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...since I've gotten back, we haven't really had a chance to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.29,0:48:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不介意的话 我们可以去吃个饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought maybe, if you'd like, we could go grab some food...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.37,0:48:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以问你一件事吗？ - 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, can I ask you something? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识了某人 你们感觉像是两个不同世界的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever met someone and it's like you're from different worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.21,0:48:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们之间却燃起了强烈的爱情火花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but you shared such a connection
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.19,0:48:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你们是注定要在一起的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you knew you were destined to be together?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.43,0:48:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但他突然间就离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he just takes off without explaining why...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.76,0:48:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,连一点解释或一句再见都没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or without even saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.68,0:48:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,蛮低级的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds cheesy, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.48,0:48:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过 也许… - 计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, maybe... - Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.89,0:48:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,说再见对他来说太困难了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...it was hard to say goodbye because he had to go...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.90,0:48:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他想说 但说不出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and he wanted to say goodbye, but maybe it was too difficult for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.44,0:48:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,困难？ 有什么好困难的 "再见"很简单啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Difficult? What's so difficult about it? "Goodbye." It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.99,0:48:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,说再见有什么困难？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so hard about saying goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.82,0:48:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到底在说谁呀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.57,0:49:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,没说谁 当我没说过吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody, just forget I said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.58,0:49:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,计程车 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.41,0:49:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.84,0:49:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.80,0:49:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,河滨路312号 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}312 Riverside Drive, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.51,0:49:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.40,0:49:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.10,0:50:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要蛋卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want egg rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.52,0:50:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法 小子 你只能吃鸡块和雪豆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice try, kiddo. Only steamed chicken and snow peas for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.02,0:50:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你明知他会过敏为何还要叫中餐外卖？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do we order Chinese if he's allergic?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.11,0:51:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他喜欢雪豆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he loves the peas...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.07,0:51:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,与微机生物制成的奶昔比起来 我们也比较喜欢吃蛋卷吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I think we all prefer egg rolls over macrobiotic shakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.24,0:51:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那倒也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.17,0:51:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现你最近举动怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I noticed you've been acting a little different lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.38,0:51:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.39,0:51:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 你写的那篇文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Lois, that article that you wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.68,0:51:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为何这世界不需要超人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Why the World Doesrt Need Superman"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.77,0:51:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 另一篇 在我们认识前写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No, the other one, from years ago, before we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.81,0:51:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一篇啊 我写了好多篇 我就是他的新闻发言人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which article? I wrote dozens about him. I was practically his press agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.52,0:51:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我和超人共渡良宵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I Spent the Night With Superman."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.74,0:51:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,理查 算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.70,0:51:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那只不过是文章的标题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the title of an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.99,0:51:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,而且那还是你叔叔派瑞的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, it was your Uncle Perry's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.00,0:51:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 我知道 没关系 - 理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I know, I know. It's okay, it's okay. - Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.62,0:52:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.75,0:52:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你那时爱着他吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you in love with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.51,0:52:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他是超人呀 所有人都爱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was Superman. Everyone was in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.55,0:52:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.69,0:52:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.27,0:52:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 我不该提这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, I shouldn 't have brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.13,0:52:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你被当成人类抚养长大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you've been raised as a human being...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.80,0:52:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你毕竟不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you are not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.05,0:52:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以成为也渴望成为伟大的人 凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can be a great people, Kal-EI. They wish to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.35,0:53:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们缺少的是一道照亮道路的光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They only lack the light to show the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.06,0:53:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这个原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For this reason above all, their capacity for good...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.98,0:53:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你 我唯一的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I have sent them you...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.15,0:53:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...my only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.56,0:54:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,把货装上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.42,0:54:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy sh...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.20,0:56:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 大都会博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, the Metropolis Museum of Natural History...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.99,0:56:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,将在十分钟后关门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will be closing in 10 minutes. We hope that you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.87,0:56:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们再过十分钟就关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, we're closing in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.91,0:56:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需要五分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only need five.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.80,0:57:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你们该走了 博物馆关门了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're done, the museum's closed. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.92,0:59:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧 小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.34,0:59:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的心脏… - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My heart. L... l... - I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.38,0:59:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我有心悸 还有心杂音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a palpitation, a heart palpitation. And a murmur.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.64,0:59:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,请你带我去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, take me to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.02,0:59:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.24,0:59:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.02,1:00:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.22,1:00:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到了 女士 - 我的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There you are, ma'am. - My heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.56,1:00:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我的心悸停止了 你做了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My palpitations, they're gone. What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.89,1:00:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么也没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.64,1:00:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me Katherine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.06,1:00:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,凯瑟琳 很高兴你没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Katherine. I'm glad you're feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.40,1:01:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还得去很多地方 救很多人？ - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have places to go, people to save? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.03,1:01:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你要不要一起喝杯咖啡…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to get a cup of coffee sometime?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.33,1:01:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道这太直接了点 酒怎么样？ - 晚安 凯瑟琳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know that's forward. Or a drink? - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.04,1:01:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.56,1:01:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好像每个频道都是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like this on every channel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.35,1:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他晚上10:55出现在马尼拉 然后又…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in Manila at 10:55 p.m. And then spotted...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.39,1:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯特 主编在等你 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Kent, chief wants to see you. - Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.32,1:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,熟食店抢劫的保安录像证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as this security footage from a simple deli robbery proves...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.44,1:01:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,恰好是超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...there's really no feat too big or too small for the Man of Steel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.74,1:01:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,洪水般的报道淹没了休斯敦和纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reports are flooding in from Metropolis, Houston, Gotham and as far...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.16,1:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星对于追踪他最没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites have proven most ineffective at tracking him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.08,1:01:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他移动速度接近光速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He might literally be moving near the speed of light.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.84,1:02:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们的地图上到处是光点 - 肯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Our map is illuminated with sightings... - Kent!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.89,1:02:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 主编在等你 - 在每个大陆上 让市民…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The chief is waiting. - on every continent, giving citizens...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.81,1:02:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这些照片很有象征性 而且是一个十二岁的小孩用手机拍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are iconic, and they were taken by a 12-year-old with a camera phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.69,1:02:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你拍到些什么 欧森？ - 我拍到这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you got, Olsen? - I got those.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.11,1:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看天空的部分 主编 - 那是鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look, in the sky, chief. - It's a bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.03,1:02:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是飞机 - 不 看 那是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a plane. - No, look, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.37,1:02:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在找我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.49,1:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特 进来坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Kent, come on in. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.37,1:02:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我想讨论一下策略问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk a little strategy. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.88,1:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 露意丝 我不懂你为何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First off, Lois, I don't understand what you're doing...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.71,1:02:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 紧追着停电的报导不放 - 那不是普通的停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- sneaking around covering the blackout. - It wasrt just a blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.17,1:02:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,手机、传呼机、汽车、飞机…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cell phones, pagers, automobiles, airplane...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.34,1:02:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其它的报社都至少有一位女记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every other paper in town has got a female reporter...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.97,1:02:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的女记者在屋顶做超人的报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a good-Iooking female reporter, stashed on the roof covering Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是唯一和超人有一段历史的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you two are the ones with history.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.73,1:03:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经做过超人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief, I've done Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.89,1:03:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,报道他 你们明白什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Covered him. You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.11,1:03:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 所以你是个专家 你要继续报导他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that makes you an expert. Do him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.44,1:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可是还有很多其它的事情可报啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a dozen other stories out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.09,1:03:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？ 举个例子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah? Name one.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.40,1:03:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天博物馆的抢劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there was a museum robbery last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.49,1:03:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,连超人也顾不及那件案子 当时忙着救这个骚货呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even Superman missed that one. He was too busy saving this hooker.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.12,1:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你们为什么不去追查雷克斯·路瑟的下落？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you guys track down Lex Luthor?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,自从他第五次上诉后就没人再看见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no one's seen him since his fifth appeal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.91,1:03:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他跟超人间有数不清的过节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got more history with Superman than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.25,1:03:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他知道些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's got something to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.92,1:03:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 路瑟是旧闻了 - 不 我觉得这主意不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Luthor's yesterday's news. - No, I like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.63,1:03:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,派瑞 雷克斯·路瑟是个职业惯犯 他还差点杀死过超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perry, Lex Luthor is a career criminal who nearly killed him, for God's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.34,1:03:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 雷克斯路瑟怎么被释放的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, how did Lex Luthor get out of prison?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.76,1:03:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,上诉法庭传超人做证 结果他没出庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, the appeals court called Superman as a witness and he wasrt around.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.48,1:03:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你想超人知道的话会不会气死？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much do you think that pisses off Superman?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.77,1:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把他交给别人吧 - 很生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Give him to someone else. - A lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很生气 - 让波莉去做吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A lot. - Polly. Give him to Polly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.61,1:03:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.32,1:03:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那大停电怎么办？ - 肯特 你做大停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the blackout? - Kent, blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.12,1:04:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 真谢谢你 主编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Thanks, chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.58,1:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 对不起 我不想这会破坏我们的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, I'm sorry. I'd hate if this damaged our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.75,1:04:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,关系？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relationship?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.63,1:04:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 嗨 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Hi, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.22,1:04:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好啊 - 大家好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, you. - Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.26,1:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他科学拿到了A 体操得了D 至少我们做对了一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got an A in science, but a D in gym, so we're doing something right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.22,1:04:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 至少我们之中有一个是对的 - 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, at least one of us is. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.39,1:04:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,派瑞 他又把超人推给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Perry. He just shoved Superman back into my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.39,1:04:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我相信你能找到办法采访超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, honey, I'm sure you can find a way to interview Superman...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.52,1:04:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,却又不让他再走进你的生活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...without bringing him back into your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.69,1:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,无可否认的 超人回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's really no way around it, folks. Superman is back in all of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.45,1:04:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在悉尼下城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're coming to you from Sydney...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.41,1:04:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在商业区的屋顶上为您做实况转播\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...where people have gathered on these rooftops to scour the sky...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.37,1:04:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不如这样吧 我们赶夜工 叫外卖来吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, how about this? We'll stay late. We'll get dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.75,1:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你写超人的报导 你跟克拉克一起写大停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll help with Superman, and you and Clark can work on the blackout together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.54,1:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得如何 克拉克？ - 帅呆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that all right with you, Clark? - Swell.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.40,1:05:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该是假装煞车失灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna pretend the brakes were out.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.61,1:05:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,假装耶 我们之前讨论过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretend. Like we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.91,1:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必真的把煞车线剪断吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't actually have to cut them!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.87,1:05:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.33,1:05:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,男人一向都知道当女人在装假 尤其是超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man can always tell when a woman is pretending, especially Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.05,1:05:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到你的石头了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did you get your rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.80,1:05:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.10,1:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,全国海岸警卫队提醒小型船只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}U.S. Coast Guard issuing a small-craft advisory for the Metropolis ocean area.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.31,1:05:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,风力很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High-wind advisory is in effect...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.31,1:05:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,潮汐越来越危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ocean currents and tides becoming increasingly dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.36,1:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所有警报持续到今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All warnings lasting until later this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.73,1:05:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,安全警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security, security.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.15,1:06:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,全国海岸警卫队提醒东北海域小型船只\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is U.S. Coast Guard issuing a small-craft advisory for northeast seas.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.78,1:06:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,风速达50英里 今早有巨浪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winds reaching 50 miles per hour, high tides in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.41,1:06:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,浪高20至30尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waves reaching 20 to 30 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.41,1:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,此警告保留4小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This warning is in effect for all small crafts for the next four hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.52,1:06:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪 如果这些时间正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird. If these times are right...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.32,1:06:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那大停电是从一个中心点开始扩散的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the blackout spread from a specific origin point.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.57,1:06:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,从哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.11,1:06:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我还不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.62,1:06:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他的超级听力是一次听到一个声音 还是听到很多声音？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the super-hearing, does he hear each sound by itself or everything at once?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.66,1:06:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.08,1:06:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他比我想像中高多了 - 六尺四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's certainly taller than I thought. - 6'4".
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.46,1:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我真羡慕他能看穿任何东西 那一定很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love that he can see through anything. I'd have fun with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.59,1:07:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,除了铅以外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything but lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.55,1:07:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想他一定… - 225磅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I bet he's... - 225 pounds...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.97,1:07:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,速度快于一颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...faster than a speeding bullet...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.80,1:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,从太阳汲取能量 除了氪星石外不怕任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...draws his power from the sun, invulnerable to anything but kryptonite...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.43,1:07:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从不说谎 - 氪星石？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and he never lies. - Kryptonite?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.64,1:07:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他的母星碎片 含有高量幅射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radioactive pieces of his home world.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.14,1:07:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那可以杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's deadly. To him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.94,1:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 你说克拉克有多高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, how tall would you say Clark is?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.86,1:07:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,六尺三、四\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 6'3", 6'4".
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.03,1:07:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,200-215磅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 200, 215 pounds?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.80,1:07:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 杰森 我们去帮这些无畏的记者们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, Jason, let's go get these intrepid reporters
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.91,1:07:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,买些晚餐让他们能继续奋斗下去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something to keep them going.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.97,1:07:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要玉米煎饼  - 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Burritos! - Come here, canead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.34,1:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这边来 除了玉米煎饼还有什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going this way. Do they have anything other than burritos?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.18,1:07:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们有炸鸡块和肉夹饼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they have fries and burgers.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.68,1:08:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到地方住了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So have you found a place to live yet?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.35,1:08:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我还在找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm still looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.69,1:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 我正好想问你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Lois, I wanted to ask you about that artic...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.36,1:08:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我正想下楼透透气 真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm gonna run downstairs for some fresh air. Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.63,1:08:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.13,1:08:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等我回来我们再聊吧 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's talk when I get back. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.40,1:09:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你实在不该吸烟的 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you really shouldn't smoke, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.45,1:09:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 我不是有意吓你 - 我没事 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sorry. Didrt mean to startle you. - I'm fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.08,1:09:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是没想到会看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wasrt expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.87,1:09:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,当时机上太多媒体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all the press on the plane...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.62,1:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那种情况下不太好说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I wasrt sure it was the best time for us to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.21,1:09:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没有媒体了 除了我以外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's no press around now. Except for me, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.59,1:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我回来后 大家都有很多问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know people are asking questions now that I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.42,1:10:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有义务回答他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's only fair that I answer those people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.64,1:10:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…你是来接受采访的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're here for an interview?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.23,1:10:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.15,1:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我把它放哪去了 - 你右边口袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where did I put that thing? - Right pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.28,1:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们由最大的问题开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start with the big question.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.16,1:10:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你跑哪去了？ - 氪星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you go? - To Krypton.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.83,1:10:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过它早就被毁灭掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you told me it was destroyed. Ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.37,1:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.00,1:10:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但有一些太空人以为 他们找到星球的残骸时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when astronomers thought they found it...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.83,1:10:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须亲自去确认一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I had to see for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.84,1:10:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你回来了 大家看起来也很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're back, and everyone seems to be pretty happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.89,1:10:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.52,1:10:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我读过那篇文章 露意丝 - 很多人都读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I read the article, Lois. - So did a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.10,1:10:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,明天他们授予我普利兹奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow they're giving me the Pulitzer...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.53,1:10:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要写那篇文章？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you write it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.73,1:10:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么可以就这样离开我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you leave us like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.28,1:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我痛过后看开了 大家都看开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I moved on. So did the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.20,1:11:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才写这篇文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.87,1:11:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这个世界不需要救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world doesn't need a savior.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.08,1:11:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.13,1:11:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.93,1:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你能跟我来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.14,1:11:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.10,1:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你看一些东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I wanna show you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.48,1:11:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.29,1:11:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能去太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't be gone long.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.62,1:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不会太久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.93,1:12:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克说你不告而别…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark said the reason you left without saying goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.85,1:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为道别对你来说太痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is because it was too unbearable for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.31,1:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得那根本就是胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Personally, I think that's a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.52,1:12:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 克拉克？ - 是我公司的同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clark? - He's just a guy I work with.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.78,1:12:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,也许克拉克说的没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Clark's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.28,1:12:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道 我的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, my...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.58,1:12:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,理查…是个飞行员 他常常带我一起去飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard, he's a pilot. He takes me up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.79,1:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这样的飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.64,1:12:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘记你身体有多温暖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot how warm you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.67,1:13:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.05,1:13:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.68,1:13:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.85,1:13:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我全听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.06,1:13:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你写道世界不需要救世主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wrote that the world doesn't need a savior...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.02,1:13:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可是每天我都听到人们的呼救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but every day I hear people crying for one.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.21,1:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起我当时离开你 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I left you, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.75,1:14:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在带你回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you back now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.93,1:16:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,理查是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.97,1:16:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你又离开那么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've been gone a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.85,1:16:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.19,1:16:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.74,1:16:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会看到你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So will I see you around?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.74,1:16:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always around.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.04,1:16:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.73,1:17:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了牛肉回来 你要用豆腐皮还是蔬菜皮？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're having beef, honey. Do you want the tofu wrap or the veggie wrap?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.40,1:17:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.82,1:17:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.58,1:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我…刚才上屋顶去透透气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was up on the roof, getting some air.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.92,1:17:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the truth now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.42,1:17:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你去抽烟吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you smoking?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.22,1:17:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.77,1:18:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.02,1:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么找到他的？ - 是他找到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where'd you find him? - He found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.07,1:18:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了 我真等不及要读这篇报导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is great. I can't wait to read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.03,1:18:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怀特先生 有关大停电…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Mr. White, about the blackout...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.61,1:18:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 今晚是你人生中最重要的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, this is the biggest night of your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.28,1:18:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你选好服装了吗 很高贵的服装吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you picked out a dress? Something snazzy?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.45,1:18:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得以这篇文章获奖很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just feels a little weird winning for that article.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.33,1:18:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不大对劲 - 哪不对劲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It just doesn't seem right. - What doesn't seem right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.54,1:18:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这篇文章说世界不需要超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winning an award for an article called "Why the World Doesrt Need Superman."
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可是所有的报纸上写的正好是相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When, according to this newspaper, they do.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.92,1:18:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 普利兹奖就像奥斯卡奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois, Pulitzer Prizes are like Academy Awards.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.01,1:18:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会记得你以什么作品得奖的 他们只会记得你得过奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody remembers what you got one for. It's just that you got one.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.30,1:18:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但… - 今晚是属于你的 好好享受吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But... - This is your night. You enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.60,1:18:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特会写大停电的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Kent's on the blackout.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.79,1:19:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,请接水电部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Department of Water and Power, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.71,1:19:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,7782 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}7782, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.46,1:19:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会工共设施部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis Public Works.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.13,1:19:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 史帝芬 我是星球日报的露意丝莲恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Stephen, Lois Lane from the Daily Planet. Blackout?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.80,1:19:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大停电？ 我只是想问一下电力分布图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need a little info on a few outstanding power grids.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.68,1:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我这里有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I do have it here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.47,1:19:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,所以住宅区在12:36时停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the uptown grid went dark at 12:36
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.55,1:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,商住宅区在那之前十秒停电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and midtown 10 seconds before.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.64,1:20:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,哪一区是最先停的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which grid was hit first?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.31,1:20:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在下林的附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just reads Vanderwon'th.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.81,1:20:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 河的对岸吗？ - 春木街6号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Across the river? - 6 Springwood Drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.36,1:20:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,春木街6号 那是个商业还是住宅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6 Springwood Drive. A residence or a business?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.78,1:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住宅 - 你确定吗？ 再之前就没有停电了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Residence. - Sure? Nothing before that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.70,1:20:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我确定 - 非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's all it shows. - Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.87,1:20:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Jason.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.96,1:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你妈妈来了 - 你迟到了 妈咪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's your mom, Jason. - You're late, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.39,1:20:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在哪里？ 这是普莉兹奖会场吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we? Is this the Pulitzer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.39,1:20:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我只是要问这家人一些问题 马上就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope. I've just gotta ask these people a few questions and then we can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.99,1:20:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以待在车子里吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I stay in the car?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.91,1:21:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.17,1:21:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们这样算擅自闯入吗？ - 不算…算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are we trespassing? - No. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.27,1:21:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.59,1:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.23,1:22:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢那顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the curly one.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.12,1:22:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走 我们不该进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. This was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.68,1:22:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯·路瑟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.47,1:22:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝·莲恩？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.40,1:22:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你秃头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bald.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.83,1:23:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.38,1:23:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可以跟陌生人讲话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not supposed to talk to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.34,1:23:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真可爱 又聪明 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cute kid, and smart. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.47,1:23:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们可不是陌生人喔 这应该可说是一个小重逢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not really strangers, are we? This is kind of a little reunion.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.84,1:23:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的仰慕者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heck, I'm a fan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.05,1:23:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love your writing...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.39,1:23:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有你的衣服 - 我喜欢你的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and your dress. - I love your boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.39,1:23:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么弄来的？ 是不是又去骗哪个寡妇的钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get it? Swindle some widow out of her money?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.35,1:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵 真幽默 你不是得了普莉兹奖吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny. Didrt you win the Pulitzer Prize...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.77,1:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,题目是我最喜欢的"为什么这世界不需要超人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for my favorite article of all time, " Why the World Doesrt Need Superman"?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.53,1:23:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你的双重无期徒刑不是还有好几年牢要坐吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didrt you have a few more years to go on that double life sentence?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.61,1:23:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,对呀 我该谢谢超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well, we can thank the Man of Steel for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.03,1:23:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他很会抓坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, he's really good at swooping in and catching the bad guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.50,1:23:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,可是他对小事就不太内行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he's not so hot at the little things, like Miranda rights...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.21,1:23:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,例如米兰达权利 正当法律程序 准时出庭作证等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...due process, making your court date.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.09,1:24:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是跟大停电事件有关？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have anything to do with the blackout?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.55,1:24:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要采访我吗 莲恩小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you fishing for an interview, Miss Lane?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.93,1:24:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你也好一阵子没出现在头版了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while since you've been a headline.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.26,1:24:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,也许人们应该再听听你的名字了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time people knew your name again.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.10,1:24:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我们把船折返回港 把我儿子送回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about we turn this boat around, call a cab for my son...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.60,1:24:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你想对我怎样都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then you can do whatever you want with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.94,1:24:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会把船折回去的 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't think we'll be turning around, Miss Lane...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.65,1:24:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们有些时间可以闲聊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...which means that we do have some time to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.45,1:24:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来个采访怎么样啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that interview?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.24,1:24:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 有任何消息请打给我 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just call me if you hear anything. Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.75,1:24:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,学校说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what did the school say?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.62,1:24:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她三点十五分就接走杰森了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She picked him up at 3: 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.38,1:24:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 我听说露意丝的事了 - 进来 克拉克 进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, I heard about Lois. - Yes, come in, Clark, come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.84,1:24:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么我可以做的吗？ - 你是记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is there anything I can do? - Yeah, you're a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.51,1:24:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮理查把她找出来 - 我去看她的电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help Richard track her down. - I'll check her computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.43,1:24:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 克拉克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Clark.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.40,1:25:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你对水晶知道多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know about crystals?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.66,1:25:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,用水晶做的吊灯很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They make great chandeliers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.95,1:25:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这块水晶看起来也许不起眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This crystal may seem unremarkable,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.95,1:25:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们那位穿紧身衣的朋友把它拿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but so is the seed of a redwood tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.12,1:25:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,建造他的北极渡假屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how our mutual friend in tights made his Arctic getaway spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.71,1:25:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还蛮可爱的 但对我来说太小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cute. It's a little small for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.75,1:25:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你想建一座岛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're building an island?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.51,1:25:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你要往更大的方面想 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not seeing the big picture here, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.01,1:25:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你把它放大吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me enlarge it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.89,1:25:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是一座岛 是一整个新大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not just an island, an entirely new continent.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.48,1:25:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,从虚无制造出的新大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An extinct world, reborn on our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.90,1:25:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.32,1:25:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,土地 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Land, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.40,1:25:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,咪咪 我父亲以前常对我说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean... Kitty, what did my father used to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.32,1:25:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你头发越来越稀疏了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're losing your hair"?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.74,1:25:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在那之前 - 滚出去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Before that. - "Get out"?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.20,1:25:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他说 钱可以印…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, " You can print money...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.66,1:26:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,钻石可以制造 人类随手抓就一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...manufacture diamonds, and people are a dime a dozen...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.46,1:26:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,可是土地…我们永远需要土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but they'll always need land."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.71,1:26:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,土地是我们唯一无法制造出来的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the one thing they're not making any more of.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.09,1:26:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可是美国…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the United States...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.18,1:26:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,美国会沉到海底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will be underwater.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.10,1:26:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是很简单的物理学 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's simple physics, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.85,1:26:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,两件物体不能同时占据同一个空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two objects cannot occupy the same space at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.81,1:26:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上其它人难道就会让你为所欲为吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rest of the world will just let you keep it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.52,1:26:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们会… - 他们会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They'Il... - They'II...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.23,1:26:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...what?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.86,1:26:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我将拥有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have advanced alien technology...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.90,1:26:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,比地球先进数千年的外星科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...thousands of years beyond what anyone could throw at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.11,1:26:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要打就来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.16,1:26:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,最后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And eventually...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.24,1:26:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上的人会来求我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the rest of the world will be begging me...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.75,1:26:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们一块高科技的海滨土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for a piece of high-tech beachfront property.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.54,1:26:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 他们会花大钱来跟我买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, they'll pay through the nose for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.29,1:26:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可是数百万人会因此而死呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But millions of people will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.21,1:26:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,数十亿  媒体又一次低估了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billions! Once again, the press underestimates me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.01,1:26:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这可登上头版新闻了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is front-page news.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.05,1:26:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 让我听你说一次 一次就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let me hear you say it just once.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.22,1:27:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是个疯子 - 不对 不是这句 另一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're insane. - No! Not that. No, the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.89,1:27:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你已经快脱口而出了 让我听吧 一次就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dangling off the tip of your tongue. Let me hear it just once, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.73,1:27:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超人绝不会让你… - 错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Superman will never... - Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.95,1:27:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.79,1:27:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you know exactly what this is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.59,1:27:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,智力战胜武力 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind over muscle, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.59,1:27:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,智力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.94,1:27:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这小孩的父亲是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is that boy's father?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.44,1:27:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.78,1:27:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,路瑟先生 我们已经接近目的座标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Luthor, we're approaching the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.86,1:27:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.62,1:28:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 北纬40度西经73度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Latitude 40 degrees north, longitude 73 degrees west.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.48,1:28:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他们离开这房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let them leave this room.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.98,1:28:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,咪咪 跟我来 你不会想错过这个的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitty, come with me. You're not gonna want to miss this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.64,1:29:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可恶 - 怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Damn it. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.18,1:29:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,她设了密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has a password.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.39,1:29:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Jason."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.06,1:29:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Richard."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.69,1:29:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,试试"超人"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try "Superman."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.40,1:30:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"超人" 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Superman." Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.16,1:30:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch that, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.50,1:30:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你去弹弹琴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go play the piano.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.21,1:32:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.77,1:34:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯 这不像模型火车呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex, this isn't like the train set.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.74,1:34:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.54,1:34:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.95,1:34:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.08,1:35:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 你还好吗 - 还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Honey, are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.13,1:35:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没受伤吧？ - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you hurt? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.34,1:36:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,开门 快开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open this door! Open it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.44,1:36:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你能帮妈咪开这个门吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you help Mommy open the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.70,1:36:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.53,1:36:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.79,1:36:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.81,1:36:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,楼下出了点小问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a little problem downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.81,1:36:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brutus is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.65,1:37:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他被钢琴撞死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He got hit with the piano.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.49,1:37:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那小孩呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.53,1:37:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,跟妈妈一起被关在食品储藏室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the mother, locked up in the pantry.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.83,1:37:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是时间了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's time for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.01,1:37:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我相机出故障了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My camera's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.30,1:37:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,手机也不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my phone's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.47,1:37:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, I'm good. - That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.20,1:37:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 从传真过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. This just came through the fax.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.70,1:37:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这是露意丝的笔迹 我不会认错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lois' handwriting, I'd recognize it anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.16,1:37:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不知道这些号码是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just... No idea what the numbers mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.17,1:37:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是坐标 - 坐标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're coordinates. - Coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.04,1:38:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这就在出海不远处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just off the coast.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.42,1:38:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 告诉派瑞我把水上飞机开走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jimmy, tell Perry I'm taking the seaplane.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.27,1:38:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 继续试她的手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep trying her cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.71,1:40:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？ 乐透号码？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are these, lottery numbers?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.72,1:40:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们是座标 主编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're coordinates, chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.42,1:40:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,主编…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.49,1:41:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.47,1:43:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,主编\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.36,1:44:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,凯撒大帝的鬼魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great Caesar's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.73,1:46:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 - 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Daddy. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.46,1:46:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.04,1:46:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,飞来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I flew.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.38,1:46:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.06,1:46:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.94,1:46:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.23,1:46:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 过来 杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, come here! Jason!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.49,1:46:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 小心头 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here! Watch your head! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.93,1:47:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.64,1:48:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.35,1:48:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.98,1:48:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拉住他了吗？ - 拉住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you got him? - I got him! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.07,1:48:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 坚持住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.38,1:48:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈  - 把他给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy! - Give him to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.88,1:48:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.09,1:48:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈妈 妈妈  - 加油 杰森 加油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy! Mommy! - Come on, Jason! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.84,1:48:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露意丝 露意丝  - 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois! Lois! - Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.16,1:49:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,杰森 到我的背上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jason, get on my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.28,1:50:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.37,1:50:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你抓紧他们了吗？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you got them? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.76,1:50:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,快上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get buckled in!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.70,1:51:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.33,1:51:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法在这种情况下起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't take off in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.87,1:51:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我可以推你一把 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll point you in the right direction. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.10,1:52:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有看到什么熟悉的东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See anything familiar?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.90,1:52:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我只看到一个老人的变态玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see an old mars sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.82,1:52:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？ 我可是看到我的新公寓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Because I see my new apartment...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.41,1:52:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有咪咪的地方 还有我朋友的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and a place for Kitty, one for my friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.62,1:52:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那边那个空间我准备租出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that place over there, I'll rent out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.09,1:52:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你说的没错 也许这里是冷了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, you know, maybe you're right. You know, maybe it is a little cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.47,1:52:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,应该怎么形容才好呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's... What's the word I'm searching for? It's a little...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.05,1:52:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有点"外星感"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...alien.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.76,1:53:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好像少了点人性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lacks that human touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.56,1:53:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿走某样属于我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have something that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.79,1:53:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会塔台 这是水上飞机 N7241H 号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis Tower, this is seaplane November-Seven-Two-Four-One-Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.25,1:53:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.67,1:53:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会塔台 这是水上飞机 N7241H 号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis Tower, this is seaplane November-Seven-Two-Four-One-Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.34,1:53:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.84,1:53:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会塔台 这是水上飞机 N7241H 号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis Tower, this is seaplane November-Seven-Two-Four-One-Hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.64,1:53:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.35,1:53:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝 你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.44,1:53:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.94,1:53:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超人救了我们 - 他去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Superman. - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.07,1:53:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.95,1:54:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 理查 我们要折回去 - 什么？ 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Richard, we have to turn around. - What? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.33,1:54:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们要回去那里  - 我们好不容易才逃出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to turn around! - We barely made it out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.12,1:54:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你又要叫我飞回去？ - 是的 求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now you want me to go back? - Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.46,1:54:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll die.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.30,1:54:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.69,1:54:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.66,1:54:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你大概在想 "怎么会"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking yourself, "How?"
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.41,1:54:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸小时候难道没教过自己 要跳跃前先看清楚吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didrt your dad ever teach you to look before you leap?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.42,1:54:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,水晶 它们真不可思议 不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crystals. They're amazing, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.55,1:54:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,它们将它们身边矿物质的特质变为己有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They inerit the traits of the minerals around them...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.97,1:55:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,就像儿子遗传爸爸的特质一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kind of like a son ineriting the traits of his father!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.56,1:55:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你从我生命中夺走好几年 我现在要报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took away five years of my life, I'm just returning the favor!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.07,1:55:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我仍是超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still Superman!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.74,1:55:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.21,1:57:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,飞吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.32,1:58:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,永别了 超人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, Superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.74,1:58:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你的领导可影响人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your leadership can stir others...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.99,1:58:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,动摇人心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...to their own capacities for moral betterment.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.33,1:58:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,人心仍受巨大谎言的影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The human heart is still subject to monstrous deceits.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.92,1:58:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的破坏要被制止 在这非常时刻…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our destruction could have been avoided. At this very moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:25.96,1:58:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你拥入怀中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I could embrace you in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.76,1:58:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你的帮助是无尽的 记住我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your help would be called for endlessly. Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.34,1:58:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是那些人类能自己解决的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for those tasks which human beings could solve themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.11,1:58:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,记住我 凯尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me, Kal-EI.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.11,1:58:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,记住我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.91,1:58:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,超人在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supermars down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.66,1:59:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确定？ - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You sure? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:13.51,1:59:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 理查  - 我看到他了 系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Richard! - Yeah, I saw him. Strap in.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:44.88,1:59:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.00,1:59:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.88,2:00:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:41.68,2:00:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,理查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richard!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.56,2:00:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力 浪太大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying! It's too choppy!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.07,2:00:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.34,2:02:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么找到我的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.85,2:02:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.45,2:03:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.54,2:03:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.50,2:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hurt!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.72,2:03:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.79,2:04:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星 超人的家乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The technology on Krypton, Superman 's home world...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.30,2:04:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,上面的科技是建立在操纵水晶上面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...was based on manipulating the growth of crystals.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.80,2:04:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像在变魔术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like hocus-pocus to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.34,2:04:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对我们这些原始的脑袋来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, naturally, to the primitive mind, any sufficiently advanced technology...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.34,2:04:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,超先进的科技跟变魔术没什么两样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...would be indistinguishable from magic.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.47,2:04:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但你想像一下： 城市、车辆 武器…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But imagine: Cities, vehicles, weapons...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.06,2:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,整个大陆由此建立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...entire continents, all grown.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:59.73,2:05:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.32,2:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有几亿人会死吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are billions of people really going to die?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.95,2:05:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.02,2:05:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯 怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.32,2:05:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,走走走 上直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go. Get to the helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.82,2:05:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Out, out! Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.37,2:06:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不不不 什么也别拿 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, take nothing! Take nothing! Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.46,2:06:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.17,2:06:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.65,2:07:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么？ - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do? - I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.78,2:07:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.93,2:07:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你做了什么？ - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you do? - I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:42.08,2:11:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看着点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.96,2:11:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让路 - 让路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clear a path. - Clear the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.72,2:11:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点  - 1号急诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! - Trauma One.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.72,2:11:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去哪？ - 1号急诊室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where we going? - Trauma One. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.89,2:12:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,看着点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.44,2:12:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got him!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.49,2:12:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I think I got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.45,2:12:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,刺穿的部位在后背右下部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Penetrating side wound to right part of lower back.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.63,2:12:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没有出血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No hemorrhage.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:29.46,2:12:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,200伏电击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shock at 200.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.97,2:12:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,够吗？ 他不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that enough? He's not human.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:32.97,2:12:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 充电到360伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, charge to three, 360.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.80,2:12:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.04,2:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这太悲观了 派瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kind of morbid, Perry.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.17,2:13:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,时刻做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:14.01,2:13:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.24,2:13:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thanks, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.04,2:13:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 露意丝？ - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lois? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.46,2:13:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你想离开的话我们随时可走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can leave whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.54,2:13:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.71,2:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不需要留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you don't have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:52.92,2:13:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where else would I be?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.92,2:13:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,警察包围了那个区域\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police have surrounded the area in order to control thousands of visitors...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.64,2:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,以便控制住数以千计的支持者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who have arrived to show their support.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:00.72,2:14:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,很多人携带标语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many are carrying signs and banners...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.68,2:14:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could drive.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:04.27,2:14:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,过去几小时内无官方消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No official announcements over the past few hours...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:06.89,2:14:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,但内部不确切的消息说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but unconfirmed reports from inside tell us...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:09.65,2:14:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,超人昏迷中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the Man of Steel lies in a coma...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:11.61,2:14:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,自昨天情况一直没变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...his condition unchanged since he was admitted late yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:21.33,2:14:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 医生们一直密切观察 - 外汇市场…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Doctors have been vigilant in their... - Foreign exchange markets...
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.04,2:14:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们要去哪？ - 医院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you going? - To the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.25,2:14:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小心一点 那边一片混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be careful down there, guys. It's a madhouse.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.84,2:14:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看来连找停车位都省了 - 你想我进得去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So much for parking. - Do you think I can get in?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:44.72,2:14:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是露意丝·莲恩 他们会让你进去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Lois Lane. They'll let you in.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:48.56,2:14:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要和妈妈去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna go with Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.58,2:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,计程车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taxi.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.42,2:15:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:23.18,2:15:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,小心你的头 我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your head, okay? Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:57.38,2:15:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这边 莲恩小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:21.53,2:16:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,妈咪 他会好起来吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy? Is he gonna get better?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.57,2:16:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 我想他好起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - I want him to.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:30.66,2:16:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:35.58,2:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:08.41,2:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你听不听得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:13.83,2:17:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听说当人们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say sometimes that when people are...
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.34,2:17:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能听见你说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sometimes they can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.39,2:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你听不听得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:40.61,2:17:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想告诉你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to tell you...
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.50,2:18:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, honey.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.12,2:19:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,请后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Step back, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.39,2:19:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,雷克斯 我们只有六颗椰子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex, we only have six of those!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.02,2:19:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,六颗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:54.11,2:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意用三十万棵椰子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would trade 300,000 coconuts...
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.62,2:20:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,加上你体内所有的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and every ounce of your blood...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.12,2:20:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来换取一罐汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...for a quart of gasoline!
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.50,2:20:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们要吃什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what will we have to eat?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.32,2:22:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会与众不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will be different.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.04,2:22:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候甚至会觉得自己被社会所被弃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, you will feel like an outcast.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:55.17,2:22:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你永远不是孤独的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll never be alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:00.26,2:23:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你将拥有我的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will make my strength your own.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.89,2:23:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你会透过你的眼睛看见我的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will see my life through your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:10.47,2:23:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,就如我会透过我的眼睛看见你的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as your life will be seen through mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:27.45,2:23:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,儿子变成了父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The son becomes the father...
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.20,2:23:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲又变成了儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and the father becomes the son.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.68,2:24:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:41.36,2:24:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}L...
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.62,2:24:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will we see you?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:55.62,2:24:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再见到你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Around?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:59.79,2:25:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always around.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.01,2:25:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 露意丝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Lois.
